111/1" remote="cros" total_fail_count="0"/><pending_commit branch="master" change_id="Ib14fda4dee825c69b9e9b4cb44f411c3a27b1b1f" commit="3e9c2f4885711b5ee25b62760a9b612053025b8e" commit_message="media-libs/arc-mesa: Add support for multilib  Use multilib-minimal eclass instead of multilib, add necessary ABI flags to dependencies, change src_configure() and src_install() into their multilib equivalents, set up arc-build in the global src_configure(), stop overriding library path, set ECONF_SOURCE path explicitly to source path and use $(get_libdir) in src_install() to dynamically determine the correct destination for current ABI.  BUG=b:36540057 TEST=emerge-reef arc-mesa  This is a reland of CL:488748.  Change-Id: Ib14fda4dee825c69b9e9b4cb44f411c3a27b1b1f Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/579112 Commit-Ready: Tomasz Figa &lt;tfiga@chromium.org&gt; Tested-by: Tomasz Figa &lt;tfiga@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Luis Hector Chavez &lt;lhchavez@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="579112" owner_email="tfiga@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="1" project="chromiumos/overlays/chromiumos-overlay" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/overlays/chromiumos-overlay" ref="refs/changes/12/579112/1" remote="cros" total_fail_count="0"/><pending_commit branch="master" change_id="Id2b18221bc04b63d4babd8ff4208fd421a559624" commit="e7711b8c4c019826031ba0a2ecab80f298a35bbb" commit_message="media-libs/arc-cros-gralloc: Enable support for multilib  Bump EAPI to 5, add necessary ABI flags to dependencies, use multilib-minimal eclass, migrate compile and install stages to multilib entry points, stop overriding compilation flags, specify BUILD_DIR explicitly before calling into multilib helpers and point the linker to appropriate library path (workaround for missing pkg-config support in this ebuild).  BUG=b:36540057 TEST=emerge-reef arc-cros-gralloc  This is a reland of CL:488749.  Change-Id: Id2b18221bc04b63d4babd8ff4208fd421a559624 Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/579113 Commit-Ready: Tomasz Figa &lt;tfiga@chromium.org&gt; Tested-by: Tomasz Figa &lt;tfiga@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Luis Hector Chavez &lt;lhchavez@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="579113" owner_email="tfiga@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="1" project="chromiumos/overlays/chromiumos-overlay" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/overlays/chromiumos-overlay" ref="refs/changes/13/579113/1" remote="cros" total_fail_count="0"/><pending_commit branch="master" change_id="Ibb77cf144286862738d267e6a3e6348655415960" commit="f1c2ca74c78ac6a8346e9b74082d8bfacd030ff5" commit_message="profiles: arch/arm: Sync up make.defaults with upstream Gentoo  Use the same default profile settings for our arch/arm profile as upstream Gentoo does as of commit b7acc0779222 (&quot;profiles: remove ruby stuff from arm, bug #615818&quot;). With this, fix buggy build environment without $ABI (and other multilib variables) defined on ARM, which is needed for interoperability with multilib eclasses and ebuilds.  BUG=b:36540057 TEST=build-packages --board=elm  This is a reland of CL:568338.  Change-Id: Ibb77cf144286862738d267e6a3e6348655415960 Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/579114 Commit-Ready: Tomasz Figa &lt;tfiga@chromium.org&gt; Tested-by: Tomasz Figa &lt;tfiga@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Luis Hector Chavez &lt;lhchavez@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="579114" owner_email="tfiga@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="1" project="chromiumos/overlays/chromiumos-overlay" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/overlays/chromiumos-overlay" ref="refs/changes/14/579114/1" remote="cros" total_fail_count="0"/><pending_commit branch="master" change_id="I751c28b9c0f3e1431e52840e5db56c5a61804d14" commit="c65815d98fed65c451f3f2658d2eda208efba661" commit_message="chromeos-base/arc-build-nyc: Add support for multilib  This patch changes the ebuild and pkg-config wrapper installed by it to properly handle sysroots with multilib enabled. This includes using multilib-minimal.eclass, patching .pc files from files/ directory with proper library path and making pkg-config wrapper use correct .pc file path depending on the $ABI enviornment variable.  BUG=b:36540057 TEST=emerge-reef arc-build-nyc arc-libpciaccess  This is a reland of CL:488743.  Change-Id: I751c28b9c0f3e1431e52840e5db56c5a61804d14 Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/579115 Commit-Ready: Tomasz Figa &lt;tfiga@chromium.org&gt; Tested-by: Tomasz Figa &lt;tfiga@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Luis Hector Chavez &lt;lhchavez@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="579115" owner_email="tfiga@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="1" project="chromiumos/overlays/chromiumos-overlay" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/overlays/chromiumos-overlay" ref="refs/changes/15/579115/1" remote="cros" total_fail_count="0"/><pending_commit branch="master" change_id="I32f4fc801c9f3035a8419bb22cbe7aba79f0c151" commit="fa120d5927a20257134c45facd0b54478e6cf7f9" commit_message="eclass/arc-build: Enable multilib support  This patch modifies the arc-build eclass to support multilib sysroots, which need overriding different variables and suffixing dependencies with ABI USE flags.  BUG=b:36540057 TEST=cbuildbot --remote reef-release kevin-release elm-release  This is a reland of CL:488744.  Change-Id: I32f4fc801c9f3035a8419bb22cbe7aba79f0c151 Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/579116 Commit-Ready: Tomasz Figa &lt;tfiga@chromium.org&gt; Tested-by: Tomasz Figa &lt;tfiga@chromium.org&gt; Reviewed-by: Luis Hector Chavez &lt;lhchavez@chromium.org&gt; " fail_count="0" gerrit_number="579116" owner_email="tfiga@chromium.org" pass_count="0" patch_number="1" project="chromiumos/overlays/chromiumos-overlay" project_url="https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/chromiumos/overlays/chromi